   "type": "1",
   "stem": "<p>彼はこの映画で純粋で不器用な <span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration-line: underline; font-family: &quot;open sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"color: inherit; font-family: &quot;open sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">　&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration-line: underline; font-family: &quot;open sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">　★　</span><span style=\"color: inherit; font-family: &quot;open sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration-line: underline; font-family: &quot;open sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span>までに演じきった。</p>",
